  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **gd1985-03-25.167020.beyer.m160.vita.miller.clugston.flac2496** (recommended): audience recording; 21 songs; 154 min [1]\n- **gd1985-03-25.167019.beyer.m160.vita.miller.clugston.flac1648**: audience recording; 21 songs; 154 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gd1985-03-25.167020.beyer.m160.vita.miller.clugston.flac2496**: taped by Jim Vita; transferred by Scott Clugston, Charlie Miller; source: Jim Vita's Master Audience Cassettes; Beyer M160 mics > Sony D5M (Maxell XLII-S) [1]. Also: Reviewer says this recording is not actually from 25 March; it doesn't match their own audience tape of that date; Master cassettes came from Jim Vita; Charlie Miller made the transfer and coordinated the effort. Source is Beyer microphones, per the filename [1][5]\n- **gd1985-03-25.167019.beyer.m160.vita.miller.clugston.flac1648**: taped by Jim Vita; transferred by Scott Clugston, Charlie Miller; source: Jim Vita's Master Audience Cassettes; Beyer M160 mics > Sony D5M (Maxell XLII-S) [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Brian Baumwoll Grateful Dead: [1985-03-21 Hampton Coliseum, Hampton, VA, USA - Jerry Garcia](https://jerrygarcia.com/show/1985-03-21-hampton-coliseum-hampton-va-usa/) [7]",
